    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1135">

                <pb facs="1433" n="1423" sameAs="frus:frus1947v07/pg1423"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.9327/11–547: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Ambassador in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Stuart</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1947-11-10T18:00:00-05:00">November 10,
                            1947—6 p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1372. Chinese should be informed Urtel (2197 Nov 5) that US glad consult in
                    accord Art XI but before US can consider question <pb facs="1434" n="1424"
                        xml:id="pg1424"/> appointing representatives etc necessary we be informed
                    officially reasons Chinese request and points on which consultation desired.</p>
                <p>For Emb info Dept perceives no urgency this matter particularly since Geneva
                        conference<anchor n="3" xml:id="d1135-f1"/> may result in agreement which
                    might solve problem Hongkong–Shanghai traffic. Emb should therefore adopt
                    reasonable delaying tactics without giving impression US not receptive idea
                    consultation. If possible US should be given advantage 60 day period figured
                    from date Chinese inform us as to specific points first paragraph.</p>
                <p>Sent Nanking as 1372; rptd Shanghai 1927.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Marshall</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d1135-f1" n="3" xml:id="d1135-f1-content">
                <p>Special Conference on Multilateral Aviation Agreement of the International Civil
                    Aviation Organization at Geneva, November 3–25, 1947.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
